# Gradle build output — the health gate runs `gradle` in the worker's clone, which
# creates these; without this file the worker's `git add -A` at publish time stages
# them into the PR (M5 loop runs produced PRs full of .gradle/ + build/ artifacts).
.gradle/
build/

# IDEs / OS cruft (defensive; a real project would have these too).
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
